    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pŏlygŏnăton</span></b> ,
			i, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυγόνατον</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The plant called Solomon's seal</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Convallaria polygonatum (Linn.),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					27, 12, 91, § 113</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Another name for</i> leucacantha, <i><span class="en">Plin. 22,
				17, 18, § 40</span></i>.</div>
